# 2026-10-30 lepss chain: Z+X build, scoring (3 models), sumw, Z+X inference, 1D card (prod), 2D + channel-split (decorrelated)
JOB ZXB zxbuild.sub
RETRY ZXB 1
JOB SUMW sumw.sub
RETRY SUMW 1
JOB S_prod_2022preEE_bkg score.sub
VARS S_prod_2022preEE_bkg model="prod" era="2022preEE" kind="bkg"
RETRY S_prod_2022preEE_bkg 1
JOB S_prod_2022preEE_sig score.sub
VARS S_prod_2022preEE_sig model="prod" era="2022preEE" kind="sig"
RETRY S_prod_2022preEE_sig 1
JOB S_prod_2022postEE_bkg score.sub
VARS S_prod_2022postEE_bkg model="prod" era="2022postEE" kind="bkg"
RETRY S_prod_2022postEE_bkg 1
